5: (204, 0, 204)
}, continuous=true)	
model im:Predicted value of risk:Hazard earth:Coast with es.coastalprotection:SeaGrass
	observing
	im:Potential value of risk:ExposureMetric hydrology:Water im:Level earth:Sea 	named sea_level_rise_index,
